sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Пользователь
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant DB_O as Orders DB
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka
    participant PS as Payments Service
    participant DB_P as Payments DB

    User->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders<br/>(ARCHIVE / TASKING / MONITORING)
    GW->>OS: Forward + X-User-Id
    activate OS
    OS->>DB_O: INSERT order<br/>status = PENDING_PAYMENT
    OS->>Kafka: OrderPaymentRequestedEvent
    OS-->>GW: 201 Created + orderId
    deactivate OS
    GW-->>User: 201 Created

    Note over Kafka, PS: Асинхронная обработка

    Kafka->>PS: payment-requests
    activate PS
    PS->>DB_P: existsById(orderId)? → false
    PS->>DB_P: UPDATE balance<br/>INSERT processed_orders
    PS->>Kafka: OrderPaymentCompletedEvent
    deactivate PS

    Kafka->>OS: payment-completed
    activate OS
    OS->>DB_O: UPDATE status = PAID
    deactivate OS